  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">All costs incurred for pre-Service training of volunteers in Worldwide locations. Includes overseas staff salaries and benefit costs, leases, staff travel, communications, conferences, supplies, equipment and International Cooperative Administrative Support Services (ICASS). Excludes costs for training, medical and security.</narrative>
